{"file":"Miro-2.0.0-v42.zip","bytes":38633,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"miro","description":"Secure access to Miro boards. Enables AI to read board context, create diagrams, and generate code with enterprise-grade security.","version":"2.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/miroapp/miro-ai","homepage":"https://miro.com","keywords":["miro","whiteboard","boards","diagrams","flowchart","mindmap","uml","mermaid","plantuml","documents","tables","stickies","wireframes","prototypes","visualization","collaboration","design-to-code","mcp","prd","specs","documentation","planning","frames","cards","shapes","connectors","images","extraction","design","requirements","tasks","tracking","todos","project-management","kanban","sync"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/miro-code-explain-on-board/SKILL.md","name":"miro-code-explain-on-board","description":"Use when the user wants to explain or visualize a codebase on a Miro board — produces a minimal, notation-correct set of architecture / structure / behavior diagrams (flowchart, UML class, UML sequence, ERD) plus a short companion document, grounded in real repo artifacts.","headings":["Explain a Codebase on a Miro Board","0. Inputs","Core diagramming principles","Workflow","1. Analyze the repo — extract candidate views (no rendering yet)","2. Design the minimal diagram set (PLAN) — announce it in chat","3. Draft each diagram (notation-bound, format-free)","4. Pre-compilation checks (MANDATORY, before writing any Mermaid)","5. Load the canvas guidance","6. Compose and create","7. Companion document","Output","References"],"name_hint":"miro · 代码 · explain · on · board","description_zh":"依据真实仓库内容，在 Miro 白板上生成精简且符号规范的架构、结构或行为图，包括流程图、UML 类图、时序图和 ERD，并附简短说明文档。"},{"path":"skills/miro-code-review/SKILL.md","name":"miro-code-review","description":"Use when the user wants to create a visual code review on a Miro board from a pull/merge request (GitHub, GitLab, or any forge), local uncommitted changes, or a branch comparison — produces a file-changes table, summary/architecture/security docs, and architecture diagrams, then links them back from the PR/MR.","headings":["Visual Code Review","Workflow","1. Identify the source from the user's request","2. Extract Changes","Current repo","External repo","Current project","External project","3. Analyze Changes","4. Risk Assessment","4.5 Triage: decide what (if anything) to create","5. Create Miro Board Content","6. Post link back to PR/MR","Output","References"],"name_hint":"miro · 代码 · 评审","description_zh":"将 PR/MR、本地未提交改动或分支差异整理为 Miro 可视化代码审查，生成文件变更表、摘要、架构及安全文档和架构图，并从 PR/MR 链接回这些材料。"},{"path":"skills/miro-code-spec/SKILL.md","name":"miro-code-spec","description":"Use when the user wants to extract a Miro board's specs (documents, diagrams, prototypes, tables, frames, images) to local `.miro/specs/` files for AI-assisted planning and implementation — accepts a board URL or single-item URL.","headings":["Extract Miro Specs","Workflow","1. Identify the URL from the user's request","2. Determine URL Scope","3. Check/Prepare Output Directory","4. Discover Items to Extract","5. Create Tasks for Extraction (MANDATORY)","6. Initialize Metadata Index","7. Extract Content from Each Item","8. Finalize Metadata Index","9. Verify and Display Summary","Common Mistakes to Avoid","Error Handling","Implementation Notes","Background","What is miro-spec?","Content Types","Board URLs vs Item URLs"],"name_hint":"miro · 代码 · spec","description_zh":"根据 Miro 白板网址或单个项目网址，将文档、图表、原型、表格、框架及图片等规格提取到本地 .miro/specs/，用于 AI 辅助规划与实现。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Miro Plugin","Components","Installation","Usage","License"]}],"mcp_servers":["miro"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".mcp.json","README.md","skills/miro-code-explain-on-board/SKILL.md","skills/miro-code-explain-on-board/references/diagramming-principles.md","skills/miro-code-review/SKILL.md","skills/miro-code-review/reference